==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]], Hyperberserker was an Insane stage. This was most likely a translation error.
*Hyperberserker is named like [[Crazed Axe Cat (Enemy)|Crazed Axe Cat]]'s stage, [[Berserk (Insane)|Berserk]], but contains [[Malevolent Dark Cat]], while [[The Devil War]] is named like [[Manic Dark Cat (Enemy)|Manic Dark Cat]]'s stage, [[Unjust War (Deadly)|Unjust War]], but contains [[Wicked Axe Cat (Enemy)|Wicked Axe Cat]].
*Prior to [[Version 13.0 Update|Version 13.0]], the enemy base had 800,000 HP instead of 2,500,000.

